  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A radioactive substance has a half-life of 5 hours and a decay constant <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda\"></span>. At time t = 20 hours <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"N\"></span> nuclei are present in the sample.</p>\n<p>What was the activity of the sample at time t = 5 hours?<br/><br/></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4N\\lambda\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"8N\\lambda\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{4N}{\\lambda}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{8N}{\\lambda}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
